      "warmupMs": 10,
      "sleepSafe": true,
      "wiring": "Battery + to a 100 kΩ resistor, that to a second 100 kΩ resistor, that to GND. The point between the two resistors goes to the ADC pin, which then sees half the battery voltage (4.2 V full LiPo reads 2.1 V). The divider factor 2 turns it back into the battery voltage.",
